   398 000001B2 1F                  <1> .r: pop  ds
   399 000001B3 5E                  <1>     pop  si
   400 000001B4 58                  <1>     pop  ax
   401 000001B5 CF                  <1>     iret
   402                              <1> 
   403                              <1> ; tick_on -- checkpoint 73h (bu_delmsg): INT 1Ch -> bu_tick, if it is still
